-- Sapientia Hungarian University of Transylvania) institutions. All facts
-- researched live against official .ro sources on 2026-09-01; RON->EUR
-- conversions use the ECB reference rate 1 EUR = 5.2567 RON, dated 2026-09-01,
-- independently confirmed at
-- https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/eurofxref-graph-ron.en.html
-- (disclosed per-row in notes). Unconfirmable facts (scholarship amounts at
-- ASE/SNSPA/Sapientia, UNITBV accommodation, exact language-test scores at
-- UAIC/ASE/Sapientia) are left NULL/omitted rather than guessed.

