-- against official .hu sources on 2026-09-01; HUF->EUR conversions use the
-- ECB reference rate 1 EUR = 366.71 HUF, dated 2026-09-01, independently
-- confirmed at
-- https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/eurofxref-graph-huf.en.html
-- (disclosed per-row in notes). Where a program's own fee page already quotes
-- EUR directly (Szeged non-EU tuition, Semmelweis CTM, Pannonia, Széchenyi,
-- Óbuda), that published EUR figure is used as-is with no conversion needed.
-- Unconfirmed facts (Semmelweis CTM admission criteria beyond fee/discount,
